**档位与文献核对**。按三档律,本节属**第一档**(新近小猜想)。目标是 OEIS **A279609** 的评注。核对对象为该条目正文与两份 b-file,已逐字读取:`https://oeis.org/search?q=id:A279609&fmt=text`、`https://oeis.org/A279609/b279609.txt`、`https://oeis.org/A004490/b004490.txt`。条目定义(`%N`,逐字):

> a(n) = floor(H(k) + exp(H(k))*log(H(k))) - sigma(k) where H(k) is the k-th harmonic number Sum_{j=1..k} 1/j and k is the n-th colossally abundant number A004490(n).

评注(`%C`,末句逐字):

> Stronger conjectures are easy to formulate--for example, if F(n) is the function defined by this sequence, then F(n)/2^n also appears to be monotone increasing.

该断言**在文献中没有证明**,也没有反例被记录;它是对全部有效指标的无界断言,不是只覆盖 b-file 已列的 22 行。

